ing there's still  some issues that I have with why the  Jedi's why the light side of the force  would be on the side of  this kind of rebellious group and  democracy but maybe there's there's  something to do with the story of Elijah  which I've pointed out before in other  videos about how in the story of Elijah  everything is upside down and the  prophet of God actually ends up being a  furtive character who has to hide in a  cave and so so yeah so I'm surprised  that I hadn't thought of that myself so  I really appreciate everybody's input  I'm going to be I'm trying with hoping  to make more videos I'm it's going to  take a few weeks before I make more  because I'm preparing for a talk that  I'm going to give it a few weeks in  Tennessee which is called Pentecost for  the zombie apocalypse and so I'm  preparing that hopefully it'll be a very  interesting talk and I'll try to find a  way to get it filmed and put it on on my  channel so that everybody can see it  I think it'll be thinking will be  interesting so everybody thanks for for  following me and I'll see you in a few  weeks
 

